<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-27T23:53:32.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:53:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan is responding to a series of Afghan Taliban attacks along the border, including mortar fire that killed one civilian and wounded five, and a cross-border strike that injured a family, by pounding Taliban positions and destroying border check posts. The Pakistani army also struck Taliban posts after a deadly attack that killed one and injured five people. These retaliatory operations follow the Taliban’s mortar fire and cross-border attacks, escalating the frontier clash. The conflict recorded 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/qatar-urges-iran-to-show-goodwill-by-ending-threats-to-the-region-and-reopening-the-strait&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1DaFg2M0tJdTVMMm9CRkZBX3BBWlBveFFCMkg1LTBhT2czZ3pzOHAwQjhEN3FtcEVEeW9jTmF2Uy0zMU5MeUhjNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/politics/article/3372306/indonesias-4-nation-defence-pact-strategic-coup-or-paper-tiger&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Recorder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Recorder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPdERsZVoyc0h6Ny1DMHFSV0dsUHI2SFZQeTNNb3Q1ZFVRYzZ1NEtMc1NZVFIxZnhKOVBrR2VFT0czbTVLdlNRYkdOYy1oLU9OVEEyYk9WaWMybDdWclJySl95aDA5UnFSZHpYdG5PbUdrODQ4c1JpT0RzdTdFbGpOeHVVQnM4anJWblFHV1duMmxybDZxMy1ldmJRWWtaV0R6eGxqenZYT29XN1hXVlFFNHBVZmEzSWdkTFNQX2pRWHBsNGVS?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CB